<title>TAIWAN: China Airlines 1996 pre-tax profit up.</title>
<headline>China Airlines 1996 pre-tax profit up.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-December 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				52,800 vs  49,900</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 1,860 vs   1,226</p>
<p>NOTE - China Airlines attributed the profit rise to growth in its cargo business and lower operating clost.</p>
</text>
